BODY:
<a href="#"><img alt="P1" src="https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9" align="top"></a> **Right-click picker stops following row**

On a touch-primary layout with a mouse, right-click stores `_projectPickerContextPoint` on the hidden actions element. `_projectPickerAnchorRect` keeps returning those original screen coordinates while the owning row remains visible. Scrolling the session list therefore leaves the picker at the old point instead of moving with its row. Store the point relative to the row and rebuild its screen coordinates from the current row position.
