BODY:
<a href="#"><img alt="P2" src="https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9" align="top"></a> **Long-press release goes untested**

`test_picker_deferred_fork_release_keeps_parent_session_in_browser` starts its first touch after the row has already been replaced. That tests a new tap, not releasing the long-press that caused the repaint. It cannot catch differences in where the browser sends the release click when the pressed element disappears.

Start the touch before the handoff, keep it held through the repaint, then release it and check that the next deliberate tap opens the child.
