- Preserve row anchors for long-press, actions-container anchors for context menus, and connected topbar anchors; preserve the existing context point.
- Added four deterministic production-helper cases and expanded the existing real-DOM browser regression to parent-with-child triggers and row anchors at 1440×900 / 390×620. Updated the manual testing plan.

